{"title":"Artificial Intelligence (AI) competitions","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>This is a resources page for students interested in <b>Artificial Intelligence (AI) competitions</b>.  Please add quality resources.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Regional_AI_competitions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Regional AI competitions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Resources\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Resources</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Past_Contests\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Past Contests</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Regional_AI_competitions\">Regional AI competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Artificial_Intelligence_(AI)_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Regional AI competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>USA-North America AI Olympiad (USA-NA-AIO): <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.usaaio.org/\">website</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=USA-NA-AIO\" title=\"USA-NA-AIO\">USA-NA-AIO</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Resources\">Resources</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Artificial_Intelligence_(AI)_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Resources\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Beaver-Edge AI Institute: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://beaver-edge.ai/\">website</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Past_Contests\">Past Contests</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Artificial_Intelligence_(AI)_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Past Contests\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>USA-North America AI Olympiad (USA-NA-AIO): <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://forum.beaver-edge.ai/\">website</a></li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Artificial_Intelligence_(AI)_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Science_competitions\" title=\"Science competitions\">Science competitions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competitions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competitions\">Mathematics competitions</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018073646\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.007 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.009 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 13/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser functi